  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN287.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">pirintu pōkāniṉṟa talaimaka ṉiṭaiccurattu niṉṟu taṉṉeñciṟkuc colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What HE who was gone after having parted [from her] said to his heart when standing in the middle of the desert.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN287.1">
        <l>toṭiyaṇi muṉkait tokuviraṟ kuvaiip</l>
        <l>paṭiva neñcamoṭu pakaṟuṇai yāka</l>
        <l>nōṅ<supplied>ko</supplied> laḷiya ṭāṉē tūṅkunilai</l>
        <l>maraiyēṟu coṟinta māttāṭ cantiṉ</l>
        <l>curaiyivar potiyi laṅkuṭic cīṟūr</l>
        <l>nāṭpali maṟanta naraikka ṇiṭṭikaip</l>
        <l>puricai mūḻkiya poriyarai yālat</l>
        <l>torutaṉi neṭu<supplied>vī</supplied> ḻutaitta kōṭai</l>
        <l>tuṇaippuṟā virikkun tuymmaḻai naṉantalaik</l>
        <l>kaṇaikkā lampiṇai yēṟupuṟa nakka</l>
        <l>volkunilai yāat tōṅkuciṉai payanta</l>
        <l>valkuṟu variniḻa lacaiyiṉ ṉōkka</l>
        <l>varampuvan talaikku mālai</l>
        <l>nirampā nīḷiṭai varuntutum yāmē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="1">Closing up [her] fingers that are crowded on the bangle-adorned forearm,</l>
        <l corresp="2">for company [only] days with a penitential heart,</l>
        <l corresp="3a-c">does she ache, pitiable she?</l>
        <l corresp="9">In the vast area of soft clouds, where the companionable doves are driven away</l>
        <l corresp="8">by the west wind that beats the one solitary long aerial root</l>
        <l corresp="7">of the banyan tree with a parched trunk that is sunk in the enclosure</l>
        <l corresp="6">of bricks with grey surface on which the daily offering was forgotten</l>
        <l corresp="5">by the little village with pretty homes, [its] public hall overgrown by calabash,</l>
        <l corresp="3d-4">with a large-trunked sandal tree against which the wild bull scratches itself, in [its] lowered position,</l>
        <l corresp="10">while the round-legged pretty doe licks the back of [her] stag,</l>
        <l corresp="12">while they look [around](?)  when resting in the dwindling dappled shade</l>
        <l corresp="11">provided by the high branches of the Yām tree in a weakened state,</l>
        <l corresp="13">in the evening that comes with mischief [and] harasses me</l>
        <l corresp="14">we will suffer on the unending long way.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
